{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "9128e5233894f501eb5fb2957bd02a4ea7441e5d4a41dfc112b1274d782d2c65", "ja": "プロフェッショナルです！", "zh": "Professional！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e0831843a33d0658cf7f5062759ffd4e5fbd67e3a0f086f76f6d3e038f0ec3d9", "ja": "ロコ達が劇場に戻ると、桃子が待ち構えて\nいた。芸術はよく分からないが、エントラ\nンスを片付けないのはよくないと注意をして\nくれた。ロコは新ユニットに必要な人材だと\n見込んで、桃子をスカウトする。", "zh": "ROCO一行人回剧场后，看到桃子在等他们。\n桃子提醒大家说她不太理解艺术该如何，\n但还是得把大厅收干净。\nROCO认为桃子是新团体所需要的人才，\n便邀请她加入。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8c8a366419afef2288601fdcd05068d73c5931d4af982feebb40576bf1f815db", "ja": "（ロコの散歩もそろそろ終わりか。\n劇場に戻って、アイディアのまとめに入るみたいだ）", "zh": "（ROCO差不多要散步完了。\n她似乎想回剧场整理她的灵感。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "68e749ea63466df42588e08126f80373b71de165eef520725022745b02483003", "ja": "なあ、{$P$}。ユニットのこと、\nイキオイでOKしちゃったけど、ホントによかったの？", "zh": "我说{$P$}，那个团体\n我一时冲动就说OK要加入了，真的不要紧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cd88c6af56ac6789d22f2203e9f56c2734fa7ea015fbf92be82bf9b2256f59da", "ja": "アタシの英語は、その……さっきの通り、そこまで\n専門的じゃないんだけど。ロコに誤解されてない？", "zh": "我的英文，那个……就像你刚才看到的那样，\n其实没那么专业耶。ROCO是不是误会了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d9f3458fe64bba8569e941f0628f201a681b3fa9e4a563862fd35015a61bdf38", "ja": "うーん、何かしらの誤解は、\nあるような気がするけど……。", "zh": "嗯～\n我觉得她好像是有产生某种误会没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c84628e2044801bbca3b7cbedfa36a5551c2545d4c098c9f2352fdf502417b5a", "ja": "歩がメンバーになってくれたこと自体は、すごくいいと\n思う。二人のお姉さん役として、よろしく頼むぞ！", "zh": "但是能邀到步你来当成员，我觉得很棒。\n就拜托你来当照顾她们两个人的大姊姊啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c076e366e6f8be90d4091edd44d7ccf905207a9fab74ddbf3bd98d3295f5c7a8", "ja": "アタシがお姉さん役……って、\n{$P$}、本気！？", "zh": "要我当大姊姊……咦，\n{$P$}，你是认真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a4245a3b3a284eb3ab6559c14b2be87f345f62728feadd6b8b1f3ea930f27191", "ja": "もちろん。おっと、そろそろ劇場に着くな。\nみんなで作戦会議でもしようか。", "zh": "那当然。哎呀，差不多要走到剧场了呢。\n那大家一起来开个作战会议吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "8b9c5ac3d8bca9a43e8440fe561a0ef75b7ddef9f337f497bd9f02553d910ccf", "ja": "ただいま～！　あ、オッス桃子！\n……って、あれ？　なんか怒ってる？", "zh": "我回来了～！啊，哈啰桃子！\n……咦，奇怪？你在生气吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "316ec3a9b87f760ad597ff7f62d9f3e7476d1c580b3d81590b7140a992898b98", "ja": "昴さん、ロコさん、歩さん。\nそれにお兄ちゃんも。", "zh": "昴姊、ROCO姊、步姊，\n还有大哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "ef7629f7a3d898908bfc3586c05b87b661323f92377aa89aeea2f8a26a66b24b", "ja": "外にでかける前に、\nやらなくちゃいけないことがあるの忘れてない？", "zh": "你们是不是忘了出去前\n有什么该做的事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "b1ada868117ffc3a6d887d23cca6782e7feb78fd7c64c06d6a2b53ec261da9d0", "ja": "やらなくちゃいけないこと……？\n何かあったっけ？", "zh": "该做的事……？\n要做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "bbdcbd80abce72bc6f208f0dd579c4f8b00d19ac302b023c6455c365153dff9c", "ja": "もう！　お片付けだよ、お片付け！", "zh": "真是的！要收拾东西啦，收拾东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "3421cb937a04898045b317825fe128dd8565605aeec66d839c9570bb26f1df0e", "ja": "倉庫から引っ張り出してきた、そこのヘンな布切れ。\nエントランスに置きっぱなしにしていったでしょ。", "zh": "那边有你们从仓库拿出来的奇怪碎布。\n你们把那些放在大厅就走掉了对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "665d922326ea78f7ca2232980f2c0c3847dae9b4413d0feccf9a4fee0a3b786a", "ja": "お客さんがびっくりして、帰っちゃったらどうするの？\nいいかげんなんだから。", "zh": "要是观众被吓到就回去了怎么办？\n真是粗心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "0de04247ca4e6b049f17e8fec611c0e14a4ef6bde48ddf843ddde8adf3f8fa14", "ja": "……あ、なーんだ。\nロコの作ったヘンなののことか！", "zh": "……啊，什么嘛～\n原来是指ROCO做的怪东西啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "d37f5b5d0cac437b183759a411cfef8032be38adb3a5350b69365906c28d8117", "ja": "ヘンなのじゃないです～！　ロコアートです！\nシンクロニシティがエクスプロージョンしたんです！", "zh": "那不是怪东西～！是Rocoart！\n是Synchronicity产生了Explosion！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "272c51a21bc7d2c24c0ef0cc660185ace601707f8beed73360a66885e7ec6abf", "ja": "桃子。ちょっとわかりにくいかもしれないが、\nそれはロコの作ったアート作品……なんだ。", "zh": "桃子，虽然可能有点不好懂，\n但那是ROCO做的艺术品啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "332ab313951e0174dc0d0861a47d53e9ec54cf67ed98010cb3f1aa1a9f35c406", "ja": "え……。\nロコさんが作ったの？", "zh": "咦……\n是ROCO姊做的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cfc244908fa559e2554c60e5dec691d4dad8a69c28b321de2a79ec37e71a4b0d", "ja": "そう。見る人によっては、じっくりと鑑賞するほどに\n魅入られてしまう……かもしれない。", "zh": "没错，然后视观者而定，\n越是仔细鉴赏可能就越被吸引……也许啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "029cb67ec9b3a4b0cd3609df181618c774ff652921027e59c0aede9970d21a16", "ja": "そんなアーティスティックなエクスペリエンスを\n感じる……かもしれない、立派な芸術作品なんだよ。", "zh": "能够让人感受到Artistic的Experience……也说不定，\n这是很了不起的艺术作品喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5484f8ea2ecaf66c28beb80295ebca677701c01ae81fb367c2b4897023c5d0e2", "ja": "そ、そっか。芸術か～。\nうん、なんとなくわかるかも！", "zh": "这、这样啊。是艺术吗～\n嗯，我好像能理解！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "234c0b7f3e180d5357e75e26a15fccec942ce94cd30d7a7d2ee48874d0f810aa", "ja": "……。\n芸術かもしれないけど……。", "zh": "……\n虽然这可能确实是艺术……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "e851c4da6a175199e3b18cfce3e97300fe487278ff7751ff8f710562532195e8", "ja": "でも、やっぱ劇場に来た人は、いきなりこれがあったら\nビックリするよなー。", "zh": "不过，你说来剧场的人\n突然看到这个会被吓到也没错啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "d0b1b8b6fd73e7d5b1f02be80cc3334ce9929c4a2a59f1c6a2ef838a14780081", "ja": "アンコンベンショナルなアートは、\nカンタンにはレセプションされないモノです……。", "zh": "Unconventional的Art\n是无法轻易就获得Reception的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b45fb6daf9e3d0bbc6c9e403939ac3b62bb523a34597abc02bd3ac0680de3069", "ja": "それならこうしないか？　このロコアートは\n俺が持ち帰って自宅に飾ることにするよ。", "zh": "那要不然这么办吧，这份Rocoart\n就让我带回去展示在自己的家里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1025_025roc", "source_sha256": "af71b13a6d50200101eabffad55613e3bca07fb64bfc59f0f8b9966ada64dd42", "ja": "うーん……。ロコのアートは、もっとマスに\nレシーブしてもらいたかったんですけど……。", "zh": "嗯……本来是希望ROCO的Art\n能够更获得Mass的Receive的说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "bc37134bb4817c7179b130acdadfbdb099143fc42d365c15055f5e6ae6ab6139", "ja": "でも、いつもお世話になってる\n{$P$}になら、あげてもいいです♪", "zh": "不过，既然是平时对ROCO照顾有加的\n{$P$}想要，那给你也没关系♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "a4d767ce26507614522e4201e61c95eebf97cf3f74bd25adf94b73c777b43ebb", "ja": "ありがとうな、ロコ。\n大切にするよ。", "zh": "谢谢你，ROCO。\n我会好好珍惜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dd4908211c845bf3292ecdd8d88a59f1b185788bc8c840faa775c553b3484eeb", "ja": "考えてみたらさ、家に芸術作品があるなんて、\nなんかカッコいいよな～！", "zh": "仔细想想，家里有艺术作品，\n听起来很帅耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "fbe905803e36cfb0ac0a0935f2117d017541a6d48f8ae52c5295094846235434", "ja": "ロコさん。\n桃子、ちょっと言い過ぎちゃった……かも。", "zh": "ROCO姊，\n桃子可能有点说得太过份了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "3edeac24ea2dbd3465d18195c45512490120547451b05a975d45f75b27c5b467", "ja": "ノープロブレムです、モモコ！", "zh": "No Problem喔，桃子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "38dcfc3dadfd9913f5032f7c8a39018827ec6da0f55756ba1c483685da0a584c", "ja": "オーディエンスのインプレッションをファーストに\n考えるモモコは、シアターにネセサリーです♪", "zh": "会将Audience的Impression视为First来考虑的桃子，\n对Theater来说是Necessary的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1032_025roc", "source_sha256": "0d7c394e906a623e197059e7dc451265421768e0ee0b7c3e584afd209673d3a4", "ja": "……むむっ、ひらめきました！\n{$P$}、ごにょごにょごにょ……。", "zh": "……唔唔，有灵感了！\n{$P$}，（窸窸窣窣）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "1291bc2628531b9b7b84b7597093932b71c49654726c9620e1e8d1b095220df3", "ja": "……うん、賛成だな。\nロコの口から伝えてもらえるか？", "zh": "……嗯，我赞成。\nROCO，可以请你亲口告诉她吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1034_025roc", "source_sha256": "dd12640c307914fe7c8c591ed238ea895629bb4073d82c62231e87057c5811e6", "ja": "オッケーです♪　モモコ、ロコズプロデュースユニット\nのメンバーとして、活躍してみる気はありませんか？", "zh": "OK的♪桃子，你有没有兴趣加入由ROCO企划的\n团体，作为一员发光发热啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "f99c7e79a1517e99313f6824dc377de162cf40147d1034361909f9829aabc445", "ja": "ロコズプロデュースユニット……？\nお兄ちゃん、何それ？", "zh": "ROCO姊企划的团体……？\n大哥哥，那是什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "433addcbf260ac2fec68689b1d361f92318fb408c1b395bee5e7ca7dce8fcfde", "ja": "新しいユニットだよ。\n今回はロコにプロデュースしてもらうことにしたんだ。", "zh": "是新团体喔。\n这次我决定交给ROCO负责企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "c75b48bfcd0586a5a06dc6a3035c48b5ebfe85c117c3dd520d0bc50f443e46f7", "ja": "そうなんだ？　……よくわからないけど。\nそういうお仕事なら、桃子はちゃんとやるだけだよ。", "zh": "是喔……虽然搞不太清楚，\n但既然是工作，桃子就会全力以赴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1038_025roc", "source_sha256": "9e1d9c594b14121abbfc6bd789008f8b68b8b830e9e5e6678c9f85e093a587de", "ja": "サンクスです、モモコ♪\nユニットのアイディアもまとまってきましたね！", "zh": "Thanks，桃子♪\n团体的Idea也逐渐成形了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1039_047sub", "source_sha256": "ea10789acb551a6963fe6222484c527463caef777f9a101ca26d0d19c6b92c36", "ja": "でもさーロコ。なんかさっきから、\n会ったやつを適当に誘ってるだけじゃないか？", "zh": "不过ROCO，怎么总觉得从刚才开始，\n你就只是在随便邀请遇到的人而已？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5f814c7937b7376887b045bd8d3c8388b7c6d3b68b11f6e2bfb99505c4aa0353", "ja": "えっ？　うそ、マジ！？", "zh": "咦？骗人的吧，真的假的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1041_025roc", "source_sha256": "6da28843f874d519e22130e23d30264d453d04319ca548bb374e195ebd618ea9", "ja": "そんなことないです！\nすべてはロコのプロジェクト通りです♪", "zh": "没这回事！\n一切都按照ROCO的Project进行着♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1042_049mom", "source_sha256": "8caab3ab1b8a19278f909955a41cd205f6851df7cf9363224ca4012388fda8c4", "ja": "お兄ちゃん。なんかちょっと不安なんだけど。\nこのユニット、大丈夫なの？", "zh": "大哥哥，桃子有点不太放心耶。\n这个团体真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "841c4ff3e0e4062ea4a7e59ef994af54f59da5f08bf923a98413449f50ca2806", "ja": "（たしかに、ちょっと不安な気はしている。\nでも、最終的には……大丈夫、だと思う！）", "zh": "（确实是有点让人不太放心。\n不过我想最后成果……应该是没问题的吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
